ure, the Wings of Victory will be moved to the Ark.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian1_intermission_01_48","type":"Speech","speaker":"liliweiss","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian1_intermission_01_48","text":"That will happen during the third phase.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian1_intermission_01_49","type":"Speech","speaker":"hongryeon_o","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian1_intermission_01_49","text":"So even our dedicated transport base shall be taken from us.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian1_intermission_01_50","type":"Speech","speaker":"hongryeon_o","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian1_intermission_01_50","text":"Is there some cause for dividing this undertaking into five phases?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian1_intermission_01_51","type":"Speech","speaker":"liliweiss","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian1_intermission_01_51","text":"There's a limit to how many people the Ark can take at one time.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian1_intermission_01_52","type":"Speech","speaker":"liliweiss","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian1_intermission_01_52","text":"So they're splitting the procedure into separate phases to ensure safety.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian1_intermission_01_53","type":"Speech","speaker":"hongryeon_o","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian1_intermission_01_53","text":"Hmph. 'Tis but a fine way of saying the highborn mean to enter first.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian1_intermission_01_54","type":"Speech","speaker":"liliweiss","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian1_intermission_01_54","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian1_intermission_01_55","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian1_intermission_01_55","text":"It's not just about the people.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian1_intermission_01_56","type":"Speech","speaker":"liliweiss","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian1_intermission_01_56","text":"That's right. The Ark has dozens of entrances,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian1_intermission_01_57","type":"Speech","speaker":"liliweiss","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian1_intermission_01_57","text":"which act as supply channels.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian1_intermission_01_58","type":"Speech","speaker":"liliweiss","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian1_intermission_01_58","text":"Since the supplies also need to be continually brought in until the very last moment, the entrances will be closed off step by step.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian1_intermi